New lookup of BBO data
- If tname
  - Scan tags, first for YEAR
  - If stored version has meet, match this too
  - If it doesn't, there shouldn't be a meet given

  - Then match the rest of the header
  - Then match the chapter
  - When testing, flag anything that is not used in headers
    Should perhaps be in header?

- If no tname but meet
  - Match YEAR first
  - Then loop over tnames for each Meet that matches
    (which means that it matches YEAR in Tname, I think)
    - Scan all tags
  - Then match the chapter
  - When testing, flag anything that is not used in headers

